he worlds for our glory,","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Corinthians 1:20","note":"For however many are the promises of God, in him is the “Yes.” Therefore also through him is the “Amen”, to the glory of God through us.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}